ining,,0,0,0,,Fine Dining                                     EiichiroDialogue: 2,0:07:12.31,0:07:13.88,Sign-FineDining,,0,0,0,,Fine Dining                                     EiichiroDialogue: 2,0:07:12.31,0:07:13.88,Sign-FineDining,,0,0,0,,Fine Dining                                     EiichiroDialogue: 2,0:07:12.31,0:07:13.88,Sign-FineDining,,0,0,0,,Fine Dining                                     EiichiroDialogue: 2,0:07:12.31,0:07:13.88,Sign-FineDining,,0,0,0,,Fine Dining                                     EiichiroDialogue: 2,0:07:12.31,0:07:13.88,Sign-FineDining,,0,0,0,,Fine Dining                                     EiichiroDialogue: 2,0:07:12.31,0:07:13.88,Sign-FineDining,,0,0,0,,Fine Dining                                     EiichiroDialogue: 0,0:07:12.31,0:07:13.88,Note,,0,0,0,,Kaliteli Yemek - EiichiroDialogue: 0,0:07:15.51,0:07:18.22,Main,,0,0,0,,3 porsiyon ramen hazır! Beklettiğimiz için özür dileriz!Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.52,0:07:20.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Afiyet olsun!Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.99,0:07:23.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Bu ramen mi?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.82,0:07:25.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Çok güzel görünüyor!Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.43,0:07:28.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Hadi deneyelim.Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.70,0:07:32.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Leziz!Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.20,0:07:35.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Evet çok güzel!Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.87,0:07:40.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Daha fazla istiyorum!Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.87,0:07:46.91,Main,,0,0,0,,3 kase daha lütfen!Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.91,0:07:48.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Tabii ki! Buyrun!Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.78,0:07:49.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Girebilir miyim?Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.36,0:08:00.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Ş-şef!Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.09,0:08:01.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Emin misin?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.13,0:08:05.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Beyefendi, konuşmamız gerekiyor!Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.60,0:08:07.99,Main,,0,0,0,,– Kahretsin, farkettiler! – Hadi tüyelim!Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.90,0:08:10.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Ödeme yapmadılar!Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.67,0:08:12.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Biri şunları yakalasın!Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.04,0:08:17.34,Main,,0,0,0,,– Ramen harikaydı! – Demiştim ben!Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.94,0:08:20.91,Main,,0,0,0,,– Yakalayalım mı?! – Daha çocuk bunlar!Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.92,0:08:29.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-yine onlar! Tam bela bunlar!  Neden onları içeri almışlar ki?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.19,0:08:34.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Kaçmalarına izin vermeyin! Biri şu çocukları yakalasın!Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.76,0:08:39.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Camdan atladıklarına inanamıyorum!Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.03,0:08:41.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Burası 4. kat!Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.83,0:08:46.04,Main,,0,0,0,,26 porsiyon ramen ve bir cam zarardayız!Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.47,0:08:50.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Ş-şef! Bir not bırakmışlar!Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.41,0:08:52.44,Sign-Independent,,0,0,0,,HAZİNE  HESABIMA YAZ  - LUFFYDialogue: 0,0:08:52.44,0:08:52.48,Sign-Independent,,0,0,0,,HAZİNE  HESABIMA YAZ  - LUFFYDialogue: 0,0:08:52.48,0:08:52.51,Sign-Independent,,0,0,0,,HAZİNE  HESABIMA YAZ  - LUFFYDialogue: 0,0:08:52.51,0:08:52.54,Sign-Independent,,0,0,0,,HAZİNE  HESABIMA YAZ  - LUFFYDialogue: 0,0:08:52.54,0:08:52.58,Sign-Independent,,0,0,0,,HAZİNE  HESABIMA YAZ  - LUFFYDialogue: 0,0:08:52.58,0:08:52.61,Sign-Independent,,0,0,0,,HAZİNE  HESABIMA YAZ  - LUFFYDialogue: 0,0:08:52.61,0:08:52.64,Sign-Independent,,0,0,0,,HAZİNE  HESABIMA YAZ  - LUFFYDialogue: 0,0:08:52.64,0:08:52.68,Sign-Independent,,0,0,0,,HAZİNE  HESABIMA YAZ  - LUFFYDialogue: 0,0:08:52.68,0:08:52.71,Sign-Independent,,0,0,0,,HAZİNE  HESABIMA YAZ  - LUFFYDialogue: 0,0:08:52.71,0:08:52.74,Sign-Independent,,0,0,0,,HAZİNE  HESABIMA YAZ  - LUFFYDialogue: 0,0:08:52.74,0:08:52.78,Sign-Independent,,0,0,0,,HAZİNE  HESABIMA YAZ  - LUFFYDialogue: 0,0:08:52.78,0:08:52.81,Sign-Independent,,0,0,0,,HAZİNE  HESABIMA YAZ  - LUFFYDialogue: 0,0:08:52.81,0:08:52.84,Sign-Independent,,0,0,0,,HAZİNE  HESABIMA YAZ  - LUFFYDialogue: 0,0:08:52.84,0:08:52.88,Sign-Independent,,0,0,0,,HAZİNE  HESABIMA YAZ  - LUFFYDialogue: 0,0:08:52.88,0:08:52.91,Sign-Independent,,0,0,0,,HAZİNE  HESABIMA YAZ  - LUFFYDialogue: 0,0:08:52.91,0:08:52