HAZİNE  HESABIMA YAZ  - LUFFYDialogue: 0,0:08:58.22,0:08:58.25,Sign-Independent,,0,0,0,,HAZİNE  HESABIMA YAZ  - LUFFYDialogue: 0,0:08:58.25,0:08:58.28,Sign-Independent,,0,0,0,,HAZİNE  HESABIMA YAZ  - LUFFYDialogue: 0,0:08:58.28,0:08:58.32,Sign-Independent,,0,0,0,,HAZİNE  HESABIMA YAZ  - LUFFYDialogue: 0,0:08:58.32,0:08:58.35,Sign-Independent,,0,0,0,,HAZİNE  HESABIMA YAZ  - LUFFYDialogue: 0,0:09:02.62,0:09:04.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo?Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.19,0:09:06.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Bu Sabo olmalı! Bekle!Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.83,0:09:09.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Ölmemişsin!Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.96,0:09:11.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Evimize dönelim!Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.73,0:09:15.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sabo! Sana diyor!Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.47,0:09:16.23,Main,,0,0,0,,O kim?Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.60,0:09:19.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Beni biriyle karıştırıyor olmalı. Gidelim!Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.24,0:09:24.01,Main,,0,0,0,,D-dur bekle!Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.35,0:09:36.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo...Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.72,0:09:41.53,Main,,0,0,0,,"Bu baharda ziyarete geleceğiz" mi?Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.53,0:09:45.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Dogra! Magra!  Bu Goa denen yer neresi?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.83,0:09:50.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Colubo Dağı, Gri Terminal ve Foosha Kasabası...Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.50,0:09:52.87,Main,,0,0,0,,hepsi Goa'nın bir parçası.Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.87,0:09:54.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Ben de öyle düşünmüştüm.Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.44,0:09:56.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Yavaş ol, Patron.Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.48,0:10:01.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Seni epeydir gazete okurken görmemiştim.  Hangi dağda kurt öldü?Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.98,0:10:03.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah!Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.88,0:10:06.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Karallığı biri ziyaret mi edecek?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.75,0:10:10.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Bütün manşetlere çıkmış...Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.02,0:10:14.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Neler oluyor? Gelmeleri o kadar büyük bir mesele mi ki?Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.86,0:10:17.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Kutsal Ejderlerin bu ziyareti?Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.23,0:10:15.26,Captions,,0,0,0,,BİR KUTSAL EJDER ZİYARET EDECEKDialogue: 0,0:10:15.26,0:10:15.29,Captions,,0,0,0,,BİR KUTSAL EJDER ZİYARET EDECEKDialogue: 0,0:10:15.29,0:10:15.33,Captions,,0,0,0,,BİR KUTSAL EJDER ZİYARET EDECEKDialogue: 0,0:10:15.33,0:10:15.36,Captions,,0,0,0,,BİR KUTSAL EJDER ZİYARET EDECEKDialogue: 0,0:10:15.36,0:10:15.39,Captions,,0,0,0,,BİR KUTSAL EJDER ZİYARET EDECEKDialogue: 0,0:10:15.39,0:10:15.43,Captions,,0,0,0,,BİR KUTSAL EJDER ZİYARET EDECEKDialogue: 0,0:10:15.43,0:10:15.46,Captions,,0,0,0,,BİR KUTSAL EJDER ZİYARET EDECEKDialogue: 0,0:10:15.46,0:10:15.49,Captions,,0,0,0,,BİR KUTSAL EJDER ZİYARET EDECEKDialogue: 0,0:10:15.49,0:10:15.53,Captions,,0,0,0,,BİR KUTSAL EJDER ZİYARET EDECEKDialogue: 0,0:10:15.53,0:10:15.56,Captions,,0,0,0,,BİR KUTSAL EJDER ZİYARET EDECEKDialogue: 0,0:10:15.56,0:10:15.59,Captions,,0,0,0,,BİR KUTSAL EJDER ZİYARET EDECEKDialogue: 0,0:10:15.59,0:10:15.63,Captions,,0,0,0,,BİR KUTSAL EJDER ZİYARET EDECEKDialogue: 0,0:10:15.63,0:10:15.66,Captions,,0,0,0,,BİR KUTSAL EJDER ZİYARET EDECEKDialogue: 0,0:10:15.66,0:10:15.69,Captions,,0,0,0,,BİR KUTSAL EJDER ZİYARET EDECEKDialogue: 0,0:10:15.69,0:10:15.73,Captions,,0,0,0,,BİR KUTSAL EJDER ZİYARET EDECEKDialogue: 0,0:10:15.73,0:10:15.76,Captions,,0,0,0,,BİR KUTSAL EJDER ZİYARET EDECEKDialogue: 0,0:10:15.76,0:10:15.79,Captions,,0,0,0,,BİR KUTSAL EJDER ZİYARET EDECEKDialogue: 0,0:10:15.79,0:10:15.83,Captions,,0,0,0,,BİR KUTSAL EJDER ZİYARET EDECEKDialogue: 0,0:10:15.83,0:10:15.86,Captions,,0,0,0,,BİR KUTSAL EJDER ZİYARET EDECEKDialogue: 0,0:10:15.86,0:10:15.89,Captions,,0,0,0,,BİR KUTSAL EJDER ZİYARET EDECEKDialogue: 0,0:10:15.89,0:10:15.93,Captions,,0,0,0,,BİR KUTSAL EJDER ZİYARET EDECEKDialogue: 0,0:10:15.93,0:10:15.96,Captions,,0,0,0,,BİR KUTSAL EJDER ZİYARET EDECEKDialogue: 0,0:10:15.96,0:10:15.99,Captions,,0,0,0,,BİR KUTSAL EJDER ZİYARET EDECEKDialogue: 0,0:10:15.99,0:10:16.03,Captions,,0,0,0,,BİR KUTSAL EJDER ZİYARET EDECEKDialogue: 0,0:10:16.03,0:10:16.06,Captions,,0,0,0,,BİR KUTSAL EJDER ZİYARET EDECEKDialogue: 0,0:10:16.06,0:10:16.09,Capt